      "note": "Codex independent TIBETAN-FIRST PROVISIONAL proposal. Each of four conception cases has its own verb and complement. Negative other-than copulas remain scoped to the correct nonliving object/complement, with repeated source/English support left unbanked. Unmistaken is retained whole and contrasts with the separate mistaken predicate; no subword splitting. Source origin 1be02f91d0c7546f4997d25cafd19c976ba4db3e through363; actual through366 acceptance is a separately supplied later checkpoint, never invented."
